cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Frehg2 in your research, please cite the software release and
  the model papers below.
type: software
title: "Frehg2: coupled surface-water / groundwater / transport model"
abstract: >-
  Frehg2 couples a semi-implicit 2D shallow-water solver with a 3D
  mass-conservative mixed-form Richards solver and explicit finite-volume
  solute transport (with baroclinic density feedback), in C++20 with
  Kokkos, MPI, PETSc, and parallel HDF5. It is a production-grade rewrite
  of the validated Frehg 1.0 research code; each of its six benchmark
  problems is a blocking, quantitative validation gate.
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Zhi
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-21"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/zLi90/frehg"
